WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.736
SOC 2 helps organizations demonstrate that they have implemented controls supporting trust,

00:00:04.736 --> 00:00:06.281
security, and operational effectiveness.

00:00:06.281 --> 00:00:09.758
It is an independent attestation framework, not a certification,

00:00:09.758 --> 00:00:15.166
and it is built around the Trust Services Criteria selected for the audit scope.

00:00:15.166 --> 00:00:16.712
Controls, evidence, audit activities,

00:00:16.712 --> 00:00:22.120
and employee participation all shape the report and the customer assurance it can provide.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:26.369
Strong SOC 2 programs treat compliance as part of normal operations,

00:00:26.369 --> 00:00:29.460
supported by clear ownership, documentation, and continuous improvement.
